profile:
Tabestic Enteron is a Latvian technical death metal/grindcore band from Jelgava, Latvia. Originally active after 2000, the band reactivated in 2024 after many years of silence. Members of Tabestic Enteron have appeared in a number of other bands (Malduguns, North Bend, Machinerie Perfect, Grondh, Nekroterror etc.). 

The original lineup: 

Dr. Fauns - vocals; 
Peteņu Malējs - guitars; 
KK:( - guitars; 
Blūdijs Maggots - bass guitar; 
425 - drums.
